   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<font color=\"#663333\"><font><font face=\"verdana,sans-serif\">Hello,</font></font></font><div><font color=\"#663333\"><font><font face=\"verdana,sans-serif\"><br></font></font></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(102,51,51);font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">to run R commands in a browser, you could setup a non-interactive console with even a simple textarea or you may look for a nifty JS library. This can be addressed quite easily I suppose.</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font color=\"#663333\"><font><font face=\"verdana,sans-serif\"><br></font></font></font></div><div><font color=\"#663333\"><font><font face=\"verdana,sans-serif\">But you should be familiar with securing/hardening your newly installed system, and take this serious :)</font></font></font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;color:rgb(102,51,51)\">I really suggest you to check out e.g. </span><a href=\"https://github.com/jeroenooms/RAppArmor\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jeroenooms/RAppArmor&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239624780000&amp;usg=AOvVaw18l4QrhskCJNyb6oFR594K\">RApparmor</a><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;color:rgb(102,51,51)\"> and </span><a href=\"https://github.com/Rapporter/sandboxR\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/Rapporter/sandboxR&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239624780000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ageWoaGvJkKdJVCA3l2na\">sandboxR</a><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;color:rgb(102,51,51)\"> packages. I have created a simple webapp for the latter, you might be interested: </span><a href=\"http://sandboxr.no-ip.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sandboxr.no-ip.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239624780000&amp;usg=AOvVaw17E6eM3W_fAfpbTHBLhKBK\">http://sandboxr.no-ip.org/</a></div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;color:rgb(102,51,51)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;color:rgb(102,51,51)\">Best,</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;color:rgb(102,51,51)\">Gergely</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, Oct 8, 2012 at 7:51 PM, lex ter <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lex...@googlemail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hello Everybody,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I finally have installed rApache on an Ubuntu (also thanks\r\nto you help).<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I wanted now to extend the site with a R console so that I\r\ncould use rApache as a connection point between R &lt;-&gt; Web<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">It should be something like (more or less^^)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">R &lt;-&gt; rApache &lt;-&gt; Apache &lt;-&gt; Web &lt;-&gt;\r\nConsole<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Did anyone know how I could achieve that?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Regards</p><span><font color=\"#888888\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Lex<u></u><u></u></p><p></p>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;rapache&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msg/rapache/-/21dc6GCbx0QJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msg/rapache/-/21dc6GCbx0QJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239624780000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1D4I1pm-QV8UxxUFb6AS6i\">https://groups.google.com/d/msg/rapache/-/21dc6GCbx0QJ</a>.<br> \r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rap...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rapache+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n\r\nFor more options, visit this group at <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/rapache?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/rapache?hl%3Den&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239624780000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2wSEAOJaKM6iYuV3A_ht9Z\">http://groups.google.com/group/rapache?hl=en</a>.<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</font></span></blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
