     "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hello,</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thank you to both of you. Your replays should bring me\r\nfurther.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">@aL3xa: No, nothing commercial, just for me and my several\r\nPC’s or better for learning more about all this stuff. =)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">@Gergely: Nice work, absolutely what I wanted. <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Now I just have to find a spot in my schedule^^ :D<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I’ll keep you up to date <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Cheers,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Lex<u></u><u></u></p>"
