     3,
     "<br>Am Montag, 8. Oktober 2012 19:51:53 UTC+2 schrieb lex ter:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hello Everybody,</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I finally have installed rApache on an Ubuntu (also thanks\r\nto you help).</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I wanted now to extend the site with a R console so that I\r\ncould use rApache as a connection point between R &lt;-&gt; Web</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">It should be something like (more or less^^)</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">R &lt;-&gt; rApache &lt;-&gt; Apache &lt;-&gt; Web &lt;-&gt;\r\nConsole</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Did anyone know how I could achieve that?</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Regards</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Lex</p><p></p></blockquote>"
