     1,
     "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\">Hey,</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">The test.R works if I call the site which I have set in the\r\n.conf file. Unfortunately it works only with print msg therefore it&#39;s not the R\r\n&quot;standard&quot;.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">My current conf file looks like:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;Location /RApacheInfo&gt;<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">        SetHandler r-info<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;/Location&gt;<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><u></u><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> </font><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;Location /rTest1&gt;<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">        SetHandler r-handler<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">        RFileHandler /var/www/R/test.R<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;/Location&gt;<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><u></u><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> </font><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;Location /R&gt;<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">        SetHandler r-script<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">        RHandler sys.source<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;/Location&gt;<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><u></u><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> </font><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;Directory /var/www/brew&gt;<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">       SetHandler r-script<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">       RHandler brew::brew<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;/Directory&gt;</font><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">I don’t understand what I’m doing wrong. Or better: it couldn’t\r\nbe that complicated, but I’m absolutely clumsy with this project / problematic^^<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Cheers<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-position:initial initial;background-re