     3,
     "<br>Am Freitag, 26. Oktober 2012 18:59:26 UTC+2 schrieb Gergely Daróczi:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><font color=\"#663333\"><font><font face=\"verdana,sans-serif\">Hi Lex,</font></font></font><div><font color=\"#663333\"><font><font face=\"verdana,sans-serif\"><br></font></font></font></div><div><font color=\"#663333\"><font><font face=\"verdana,sans-serif\">does &quot;/R/test.R&quot; work as expected? So if you POST some commands directly, does it show the results?</font></font></font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font color=\"#663333\"><font><font face=\"verdana,sans-serif\"><br></font></font></font></div><div><font color=\"#663333\"><font><font face=\"verdana,sans-serif\">You can use any extension you wish on your server, just <a href=\"http://rapache.net/manual.html#Configuring_rapache\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rapache.net/manual.html%23Configuring_rapache&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239624793000&amp;usg=AOvVaw11IVRJzMy5cQ5SnjAotUFe\">configure RApache</a> to handle that.</font></font></font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font color=\"#663333\"><font><font face=\"verdana,sans-serif\"><br></font></font></font></div><div><font color=\"#663333\"><font><font face=\"verdana,sans-serif\">Best,</font></font></font></div><div><font color=\"#663333\"><font><font face=\"verdana,sans-serif\">Gergely<br>\r\n\r\n</font></font></font><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Fri, Oct 26, 2012 at 5:12 PM, lex ter <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">lex...@googlemail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Hello again,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">I have implemented now simple HTML site with a textarea as my “Console”<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">To send the data to R, I tried out (among other):<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">\r\n\r\n<br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">$.post(&quot;/R/test.R&quot;, $(&quot;#terminal&quot;).val(),\r\nfunction(data) {<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    $(&quot;#result&quot;).html(data);<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">});</font><u></u><u></u></p><p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">#result is a normal div. <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Unfortunately I don’t get any result.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">I have seen that, Gergely uses RHTML. I want to avoid this format. Only\r\n.R or .html file. <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Does anyone know how I could send the terminal data into a File that RApache\r\ncould interpret?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Cheers,<u></u><u></u></p><div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Lex</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><br></p><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;rapache&quot; group.<br></div>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msg/rapache/-/Rpq4tUzWvfoJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msg/rapache/-/Rpq4tUzWvfoJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239624793000&amp;usg=AOvVaw29ezLp05xS4eGZijwY9duj\">https://groups.google.com/d/msg/rapache/-/Rpq4tUzWvfoJ</a>.<div><div><br>\r\n\r\n \r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">rap...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group, send email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">rapache+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\